1
00:00:00,683 --> 00:00:02,973
(Sheldon:)- Do you have a sword collection?
- No.

2
00:00:03,144 --> 00:00:05,394
Heh, I'm not surprised.

3
00:00:06,147 --> 00:00:08,187
Here's the Batman six twelve...

4
00:00:08,357 --> 00:00:10,857
...with the Jim Lee aIternate cover
that you wanted.

5
00:00:11,027 --> 00:00:13,527
- Oh, awesome. What do I owe you?
- Forty bucks.

6
00:00:13,696 --> 00:00:15,486
- Good deal.
- Sucker.

7
00:00:15,656 --> 00:00:18,446
He didn't even ask
for the friends and family discount.

8
00:00:18,618 --> 00:00:21,708
I'm having a party on Friday
and I was hoping you would stop by.

9
00:00:21,871 --> 00:00:24,001
- Will there be girls there?
- Of course.

10
00:00:24,165 --> 00:00:27,205
Because there wasn't last time.

11
00:00:28,836 --> 00:00:30,216
(Wil:)There will be girls.

12
00:00:30,796 --> 00:00:32,886
(Wil:)You guys are invited
if you want to come by.

13
00:00:33,049 --> 00:00:36,839
(Bernadette:)- Thank you.
- All right, great. Later.

14
00:00:38,888 --> 00:00:40,768
(Sheldon:)I see what you're doing.

15
00:00:40,932 --> 00:00:44,102
(Sheldon:)You accept an invitation to a party
at the home of my sworn enemy.

16
00:00:44,268 --> 00:00:46,268
(Sheldon:)He tells everyone
we're going to be there.

17
00:00:46,437 --> 00:00:49,397
(Sheldon:)And when we don't show,
he looks the fooI. Fiendishly clever.

18
00:00:51,442 --> 00:00:53,692
(Leonard:)I was actually thinking about going.

19
00:00:54,237 --> 00:00:56,947
(Sheldon:)And then declaring the party
a fiasco and storming out...

20
00:00:57,114 --> 00:01:00,824
(Sheldon:)...leaving him humiliated
in front of his guests. Love it.

21
00:01:01,953 --> 00:01:06,083
(Leonard:)No, I was gonna grab Raj
and Howard and have a good time.

22
00:01:06,249 --> 00:01:08,169
Ah, great, more guys.

23
00:01:08,334 --> 00:01:13,024
(Stuart:)It's gonna be another Wil Wheaton
sausage-fest.

